            "code": "\timport quality as qa\n\tdone \u003d qa.completeJob(\n\t\tself.view.params.jobId,\n\t\tdict(self.view.custom.qc),\n\t\t[dict(r) for r in self.view.custom.wireRows],\n\t\tqa.buildContext(self.session) \n\t)\n\tif done:\n\t\tself.view.custom.jobStatus \u003d \u0027COMPLETED\u0027\n\treturn value",
